== Sunbreak Systems

Sunbreak is not just harder monsters — it is a second game's worth of systems layered on the base. This chapter is the tour.

=== Master Rank & Elgado

- *Master Rank (MR)* is the third tier: MR monsters are faster, harder, and drop MR-only materials for MR-only gear. Village and Hub ranks do not carry over — MR is a fresh ladder of quest stars.
- *Elgado* is the new hub: new NPCs, new facilities, new quest lines. Follow the story markers; they guide the unlock order.
- MR gear invalidates HR gear quickly — plan to re-equip as you climb, don't cling to old sets.

=== Followers

The expansion's gift to solo hunters: *Followers* — named NPCs who join your hunts as AI partners.

- *Follower Quests* unlock followers and let you hunt alongside them.
- Followers are genuinely competent: they heal, trap, and ride; some are exceptional at specific weapons.
- Use follower quests to learn new weapons in a safe environment — you have a team, so mistakes cost less.

#tip[
  Follower hunts are the best training ground in the game: bring your worst weapon, let the followers carry the pressure, and read the monster at your own pace.
]

=== Afflicted Monsters

The *qurio* curse creates *afflicted* monsters — base monsters turned up to eleven:

- Afflicted monsters take reduced damage until you break their *qurio clusters* (the glowing parts). Breaking clusters staggers them and drops special materials.
- Afflicted materials feed the endgame crafting economy (Qurio Crafting, and later Anomaly Quests — Part 5).
- Expect afflicted hunts to feel like *two* monsters: the base fight plus the cluster management minigame.

=== Qurio Crafting (Weapon Augments)

*Qurio Crafting* lets you spend afflicted materials to *augment* weapons — rolling bonus stats or skill slots onto them:

- Augments come in flavors: attack, defense, element, slots, skills — each with its own material cost.
- Augmenting is random; you reroll with more materials. Budget accordingly.
- It is the long-tail upgrade path: your endgame weapon is the one you augments into shape over dozens of hunts.

=== Switch Skill Swap — the Second Loadout (recap)

Unlocked through MR story progression: two scrolls, swap mid-hunt, role-shift between aggression and survival. See *Advanced Combat* for how to weaponize it.

=== Where This Leaves You

By the end of the Sunbreak story you have: Master Rank gear, afflicted farming, follower friends, and augments on your best weapons. That is the on-ramp to the true endgame — which is exactly what Wave 2 exists to organize.
